cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the permanent Zenodo concept DOI for the work and, when an exact
  published revision is required, cite that revision's version-specific DOI
  and verify its Git tag and frozen artifact manifest.
type: software
title: >-
  Euclidean Condensate Theory (ECT) English publication and reproducibility
  repository
authors:
  - family-names: Blagovidov
    given-names: Valeriy
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-6707-7068"
repository-code: "https://github.com/chufelo/ECT-preprint-code"
url: "https://github.com/chufelo/ECT-preprint-code"
abstract: >-
  English source, reproducibility tools, data and figure provenance for the
  Euclidean Condensate Theory technical preprint, narrative companion, and
  compact summary. The manuscripts separate model-internal derivations,
  conditional structures, phenomenological or benchmark results, and Open
  physical owners. Licensing for author-owned manuscript material and figures
  is separate from licensing for author-owned code and from third-party terms.
keywords:
  - Euclidean Condensate Theory
  - Euclidean scalar condensate
  - O(4) to O(3) symmetry breaking
  - Lorentzian principal symbol
  - open quantum systems
  - conditional emergent gravity
  - galaxy rotation curves
  - cosmological diagnostics
  - reproducible research
